"installed plugins and themes, outbound hosts, sensitive hooks, scheduled "
"tasks, hardening and integrity results. Download it or copy it, paste it "
"into ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini or another assistant, and ask your question. No"
" need to explain what the file is."
